  "raid": {
    "size": 40,
    "tanks": 4,
    "healers": 10,
    "dps": 26
  },
  "notes": [
    "B1 prep (task of the raid master plan) from the world DB, the core's upper_karazhan_halls scripts and the server's map 814 navmesh: 18 legs, 56 merged pull groups (183 units). Not mapped, not live-checked: the GM-invisible mapping walk (B2) and the first live run are still to do; dungeon_run refuses it without allow_draft.",
    "Packs: the dungeongen draft's 76 pull groups (204 units) held 15 neutral NPCs (62023 Draenei Villager 6, 62024 Starving Draenei 5, 62025 Draenei Waterseeker 2, 62027 Na'va D'at, 62028 Kasat T'andr: faction 7 'Creature', no hostile mask; the map's 16th neutral, 62029 Rud'an Malas, was not in the draft; 61990/61997-62003 and 62030 are faction 35 'Friendly'); none is in a pull. The 189 hostile units are chained where they stand within 15 yd on one floor (|dz| \u003c= 4), never a boss, a patrol or a linked boss add into trash, at most 16 units (a 40-man), and every pair's walk is at most 2.2 times their distance plus 8 yd (353 candidate edges, none removed: the map's mesh has no wall-crossing pair within 15 yd). 59 packs result; the pull-reach closure moves 1 unit into a pack and empties 1 (58); Rupturan's four Crumbling Exiles 59960 and Sanv's two Draenei Truthseekers 59980 are their bosses' first entries, not pulls (56 pull groups, 183 units). Radius = the pack's own spread from its centre + 0.5, capped by the nearest spawn of every entry and at most 35; the largest is 22.2 (manascale_hall_east, 13 units).",
    "Route: the tower is a spiral, so the legs are bands of Detour path length from the entrance (karaforty), not rooms: entrance_hall (8 units), tower_ramp (20), tower_hall (15), Keeper Gnarlmoon (10 + 61939), manascale_hall_west (26), manascale_hall_east (53), Ley-Watcher Incantagos (11 + 61946), arcane_hall (16), Anomalus (13 + 61951), upper_spire (5), upper_spire_top (4), Echo of Medivh (61958), the chess event (King 59967), then the Outland part: outland_landing (62022 Draenei Worshipper), outland_cave (62020 Outcast Souleater), Sanv Tas'dal (59981, adds 59980), Rupturan the Broken (59961, adds 59960), Kruul (59991). That order is the guide's, and the path lengths agree (entrance -\u003e 632 yd Gnarlmoon -\u003e 1066 Incantagos -\u003e 1545 Anomalus -\u003e 1990 Echo -\u003e 2093 King).",
    "The Outland part (map region x -7200..-6000, z -38..49) is a separate navmesh island: no normal path from any tower point (the entrance to Sanv is 4427 yd of partial path, ending at -10817.6 -2002.1 92.2). Its legs start with a gm_cross waypoint at the game_tele 'karaoutland' landing (-6078.86 -2395.53 49.2521); Sanv's platform is a second island (25.8 yd across, 9 yd down from the nearest tower-part floor: no direct step crosses it), so his leg has its own gm_cross at -6440 -2720 21.9. A run leader has no GM move (plan-export writes a move_direct, docs/play/dungeon-run-leader.md 'Not supported yet'): reaching Sanv, Rupturan and Kruul with the module's run leader is an open blocker for B2/Phase C (see the prep report).",
    "The chess event: King 59967 is invulnerable (aura 51228) until the Bishop 59971, the Rook 59970 and the Knight 59968 are dead (npc_kara_kingAI removes it when IsOnlyPiece); the pawns 59972 are summoned by the King (51230). The boss step's first list is 59971, 59970, 59968. Incantagos' four Ley Seekers 59989 are summoned around him at spawn (SummonLeyWatchers, each a 25% damage reduction stack) and are his first entry; the fight's affinities and whelps are summoned by spells. Sanv's two Truthseekers and Rupturan's four Exiles are creature_group-linked to their bosses (flags 30 and 19) and are the boss rows' first entries.",
    "Doors and events: the map's 11 game objects are Khadgar's Journal 2020098, the three book props 2020111/2020112, an Anvil 179392 and open door models (2008293, 2008294, 3000282, 3000297 at state 1). No door, lever, key, gong, orb or gossip gates the route (no instance script, no boss npc_flags gossip); the plan has no use_object, wait_for, gossip or hold step.",
    "Rupturan 59961 has a rank-3 spawn row (-6248.46 -2863.91 -37.6695, 852333 hp, movement type 2) but no script or EventAI: a dummy boss. Mephistroth, the guide's ninth boss, has no creature_template, no spawn row and no script in this core or world data (only its loot/quest text), so it cannot be a leg: the plan has eight bosses.",
    "Patrols: 11 map-814 spawns walk a creature_movement path (movement type 2): 61933, 61936 x2, 61938, 61942 x2, 61943 x2, 61944, 61945, 61950. Each is its own pull group with a patrol block (path, period_s = path length at 2.5 yd/s, period_estimate true, source guid): plan-check warns on all 11, because the mapping walk must measure the real rounds. The boss Rupturan is movement type 2 too but has no path.",
    "Every leg starts at a stand its first pack can be pulled from (18 `to` points); 27 packs (31 stands) and 5 bosses (6 stands) carry approach points (up to 4 each, every hop server-path checked), and the Kruul leg walks 24 via points along the 954 yd cave from Rupturan. plan-check: ok, 273 points, 0 failures, 3 exempt (the gm_cross points), 11 warnings (the estimated patrol periods only)."
  ],
